    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to welcome to the market No. 2 East Road, a beautifully contemporised four bedroom family home in a highly sought after and central location less than 1.5km outside of the City Centre.\n\nOne of the standout features of this home is the double storey side extension, creating a striking double fronted façade, the inclusion of a downstairs bathroom and an abundance of additional internal space on the ground and first floors adding versatility and comfort to the property, ideal for accommodating growing families or excellent space for a work from home office. \n\nNo expense has been spared in the careful refurbishment of this property, from quality flooring throughout, new glass panelled internal doors and architraves, high quality sanitary ware in all bathrooms, new built-in cabinetry and storage units and a sleek, minimalist style kitchen complete with Belfast sink, double oven and brushed brass fittings.\n\nThe upgrades extend beyond the interior with newly replaced triple glazed windows throughout, high efficiency gas boiler, high levels of insulation and new slate roof, all contributing to an impressive and efficient B3 energy rating allowing loan approved buyers the option to avail of green mortgage rates.\n\nThe property further benefits from an extra spacious, cobblelock front driveway allowing parking for up to four cars and a convenient side access through to the rear garden.\n\nThis fantastic property truly speaks for itself and stands ready for it's new owners to simply turn the key and enjoy. \n\nEast Road is conveniently located just a five minute walk to a range of local shops, cafes and restaurants on Church Road and the new Lidl and Aldi supermarkets on East Wall Road. Fairview Park and Clontarf seafront promenade are also within easy reach whilst Dublin City Centre and East Point Business Park are both a short distance away. East Wall is a convenient base for commuters with Bus and DART services running close by and for those who use the Port Tunnel or East Link Bridge, each are a two minute drive from the property."
      },
